<title>SINGAPORE: Sing Technologies ups dividend to 15 pct.</title>
<headline>Sing Technologies ups dividend to 15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore Technologies Industrial Corp (STIC) said on Monday it was proposing a first and final dividend of 15 percent less tax for 1996, up from 10 percent less tax in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
